            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Por qué pasamos una función como parámetro dentro de <code>.reduce()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Para decirle a la función <code>.reduce()</code> cómo combinar los valores del juego en un solo resultado</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Para decirle a la función <code>.reduce()</code> qué array modificar</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Para decirle a la función <code>.reduce()</code> qué elementos mantener o eliminar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Para decirle a la función <code>.reduce()</code> cómo combinar los valores del juego en un solo resultado.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148389,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa la sintaxis para llamar a la función <code>.reduce()</code> en el array <code>coinPickups</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"78\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coinPickups = [\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalCoins = coinPickups.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prevVal + currVal;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(totalCoins);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>coinPickups.reduce</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148390,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cuál es la cantidad mínima de parámetros que necesitamos para que <code>.reduce()</code> funcione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">2</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">3</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">1</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir 2.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148391,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica una función flecha que tome dos parámetros ( <code>prev</code> y <code>curr</code> ) y devuelva su suma.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"comboHits\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" comboHits = [\" /><text value=\"250\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"125\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"465\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" comboTotal = comboHits.reduce(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prev, curr\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" prev + curr);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(comboTotal);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>(</code> seguido de <code>prev</code> y luego <code>,</code>, <code>curr</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>=&gt;</code>, <code>prev + curr</code>.</p></body></html>"
